<title>USA: Malibu will reach decision soon on split.</title>
<headline>Malibu will reach decision soon on split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malibu Inc said Wednesday it will reach a decision soon on whether a forward stock split would be beneficial to the company and its shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said it is considering this decision as a result of recent consultations with its financial advisors.</p>
</text>
